From 9cc44fcaea5ac737ba852794c4a4197017a44020 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:38:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] virtio-blk: use the request iovecs directly for complete
 I/O windows

Keep the guest mapping and the vector that describes it owned by the request until completion. Only allocate scratch space when the byte limit cuts through an iovec. Sync and Async use the same window boundaries and short completion handling.

Signed-off-by: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
---
